# Curated feed source logos

Do not add or expand **catalog** feeds (`kind` curated/recommended in `seed_demo` / feed seed migrations) without a matching source logo for Stories fallbacks.

## Do (same change)

1. Add a real logo asset under `web/static/img/sources/` (prefer SVG from Wikimedia Commons or the publisher’s site; no hand-drawn stand-ins)
2. Map host (and title fallback) in `_SOURCE_LOGOS` / `title_map` in `web/news/templatetags/news_extras.py`
3. Add brand fallback backgrounds for `.story-media-logo[data-source="…"]` and `.stack-source[data-source="…"]` in `web/static/css/app.css`
4. Keep `seed_demo.FEEDS` and the latest catalog seed migration in sync

## Don't

- Land a new catalog feed with only title/URL/site_url and no logo wiring
- Invent SVG paths by hand when a real asset can be fetched
- Skip the logo work with “follow up later” unless the user explicitly defers it

## If a logo cannot be fetched

Stop and tell the user which source still needs a file (name + suggested save path under `web/static/img/sources/`), instead of shipping the feed without one.
